1.97 adds\n129bf2c Restore the plan's sections 4 to 12 and record A4\nf2898c6 Close A4: land to the workspace's branch, reload pages on focus\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"pure-pondering-goose"}
