{"parentUuid":"79acce6f-8ce9-4c6f-be17-9170c9478f19","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4ff2de2d-1928-42ed-8fcf-65f2b442b6fc","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MQopuP2rTtCAPqgz1m1Pnj","type":"tool_result","content":"28:/// The tools a turn may call. A pre-trigger hook pins each to the job's VM.\n30:    \"sandbox::exec\",\n31:    \"sandbox::fs::read\",\n32:    \"sandbox::fs::write\",\n33:    \"sandbox::fs::ls\",\n37:/// How a turn reaches its VM. The pre-trigger hook replaces `sandbox_id`, so\n39:const TOOL_GUIDE: &str = \"\\\n41:Call sandbox::exec with {\\\"sandbox_id\\\": \\\"job\\\", \\\"argv\\\": [\\\"git\\\", \\\"-C\\\", \\\"/work/repo\\\", \\\"status\\\"]},\n42:and sandbox::fs::read, sandbox::fs::write and sandbox::fs::ls with {\\\"sandbox_id\\\": \\\"job\\\", \\\"path\\\": ...}.\n103:    /// Pin every `sandbox::*` call a turn makes to its job's VM, then resume.\n106:            \"harness::hook::pre-trigger\",\n107:            json!({ \"functions\": [\"sandbox::*\"], \"on_error\": \"fail_closed\", \"timeout_ms\": 5000 }),\n280:                \"sandbox::exec\",\n349:                \"sandbox::create\",\n355:            .ok_or(\"sandbox::create gave no sandbox_id\")?\n376:            .call_for(DEFAULT_NAMESPACE, \"sandbox::fs::write\", json!({ \"sandbox_id\": sandbox, \"path\": \"/work/in.bundle\", \"content_b64\": base64::engine::general_purpose::STANDARD.encode(&bytes), \"parents\": true }), SLOW_MS)\n449:        message.push_str(TOOL_GUIDE);\n462:                \"options\": { \"max_turns\": MAX_TURN_STEPS, \"functions\": { \"allow\": TOOLS }, \"metadata\": { \"sandbox_id\": sandbox, \"job\": job.id, \"stage\": stage } },\n628:                \"sandbox::fs::read\",\n701:                    \"sandbox::stop\",\n4073:name = \"sha2\"\n4074-version = \"0.10.9\"","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ff67c80c-936e-4fa2-a930-4f1ab1e3b974","timestamp":"2026-10-31T05:16:09.587Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"28:/// The tools a turn may call. A 