{"parentUuid":"3ff110ac-676a-44ee-8f53-6c5d04145935","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"67bb59de-bcef-4734-b132-98dfea5518d3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019xfi1u67we3AuWrGHR2edc","type":"tool_result","content":"seams ok\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 1.96s\ntest result: ok. 39 passed; 0 failed; 4 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.08s\ntest result: ok. 37 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\ntest result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n[entire] Pushing 1 checkpoint ref(s) to origin..................................................................... done\nb4f2704 A5 step 4: held calls on the job page, and the Governance page","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8d9d9a3c-22fd-4e46-9d0b-a53bd81c7b97","timestamp":"2026-10-31T15:03:06.277Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"seams ok\n    Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 1.96s\ntest result: ok. 39 passed; 0 failed; 4 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.08s\ntest result: ok. 37 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\ntest result: ok. 1 passed; 0 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.00s\n[entire] Pushing 1 checkpoint ref(s) to origin..................................................................... done\nb4f2704 A5 step 4: held calls on the job page, and the Governance page","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/PLAN.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":648,"oldLines":7,"newStart":648,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | A2 | done | The console on the Engine page: containers with versions, state, stop, start and live logs; functions and trigger types with a filter; queues with depth, delivered, failed and dead letters. One `console` read through the Engine seam, 23 tests. Live exit (2026-10-30): `judge` stopped and started from the window, a stop made from the CLI reached the page by push with no reload, and its logs streamed. `ade` was removed with `compose::remove` (23 containers), so nothing in the stack serves HTTP. |"," | A3 | done | `bastion-core` (9caf363), the Store (93b5cb8), spike N7 (c640769), the factory loop (88f45fb), and the first views (778016d), with fixes from the exit. 28 app tests and 15 core tests pass. Live exit (2026-10-30), driven in the window: two workspaces added through the form; three requests in them reached the approve checkpoint with plan artifacts, three plan turns on gpt-5-mini; a comment on the `subtract` plan (add a docstring, rename the test) came back in the next plan; `multiply` was stopped and its VM went away; the app was quit with the stack kept running and reopened, and both other jobs were still at approve; `divide` was then approved, ran its build turn, and reached review with its artifact. The owner then moved the views from a floor and an inbox to a Jobs page and a job page, after GitHub Actions and wipp (2026-10-30): the Jobs page groups waiting for you, in progress and finished, with a workspace filter and search; the job page shows the badges, a waiting panel with the artifact it judges, and the pipeline as steps whose states come from `bastion_core::steps`; workspaces moved to Settings. Checked in the window on the live jobs. |"," | A4 | done | The diff, captured from the VM after each build and shown per file with line comments (e5da6d7). The checkpoint dial: ask, hold and auto, review never below hold, holds resumed after a restart (0bdb745). Turn guide and uncommitted-work flag (4b46dca). Landing fixes: the bundle names the branch, a failed land waits on the owner with its VM, and the land passes `target_branch` (75adbe2, f2898c6). 24 core tests, 29 app tests. Live exit (2026-10-31), driven in the window: on `divide`, line comments on `calc.py:5` and `test_calc.py:3` came back verbatim and each next diff answered them; on `subtract`, the owner approved the plan and the review, the land failed once on `target_checked_out_dirty` (an untracked `__pycache__` in the target) and waited, and Approve retried it: `demo-a` main got `0e30e2f`, both tests pass, and the VM is gone. Not run live: a hold expiring (30 min); the core and loop tests cover it. |","-| A5 | in progress | Spike N8 passes: a hook denies, holds and releases a call (e7fb375). `mise.toml` pins Rust 1.97 so local checks match CI (c8c6518). Step 1, the rules in `bastion-core`: constraint and capability ladders, the gate, and the audit chain. Next: the Store tables, the hook wired to the gate, held calls on the job page, and the Constraints, Capabilities and Audit pages. |","+| A5 | in progress | Spike N8 passes: a hook denies, holds and releases a call (e7fb375). `mise.toml` pins Rust 1.97 so local checks match CI (c8c6518). Step 1, the rules in `bastion-core`: constraint and capability ladders, the gate, and the audit chain (def679b). Steps 2 and 3: the governance tables with the owner's defaults seeded once, and the `pre-trigger` hook judged by the gate, with holds and audit records written by one task off the hook's path (a509bb1). Step 4: held calls on the job page (allow once, or refuse with a note), and a Governance page with the constraints and grants on their ladders and the audit chain verified as it is read. 37 core tests, 39 app tests. Next: the live exit. Not yet built: charter-sourced constraints, repository hooks, audit export, and the audit timeout test. |"," | A6 to A13 | — | — |"," | Later (§10) | on hold | — |"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion/PLAN.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e0317f5c-6517-46fa-8029-a0f5d7cfb106","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","root":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":5,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3ff110ac-676a-44ee-8f53-6c5d04145935","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"pure-pondering-goose"}
